						<div class="zox-post-main">
														<div class="zox-post-body-wrap left zoxrel">
	<div class="zox-post-body left zoxrel zox100">
		<p><em>ReBlade: The Death Spiral</em> has released its first Steam demo, offering a look at its cyberpunk setting and mechanical creatures inspired by Chinese mythology. Developer ChillyRoom and publisher Spiral Up Games have made the demo available through November 10, extending beyond Steam Next Fest.</p>
<p><iframe title="ReBlade: The Death Spiral | Steam Next Fest Demo Trailer" width="880" height="495" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/Jd1-PALI6fg?feature=oembed" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allowfullscreen></iframe></p>
<p>You play as a condemned synthetic heroine caught in a cycle of death and rebirth, fighting to understand the forces behind it and find a way out.</p>
<p><a href="https://monstervine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Reblade-The-Death-Spiral-screenshot-02.jpg"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="aligncenter size-medium wp-image-106478" src="https://monstervine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Reblade-The-Death-Spiral-screenshot-02-640x335.jpg" alt="Reblade The Death Spiral screenshot" width="640" height="335" srcset="https://monstervine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Reblade-The-Death-Spiral-screenshot-02-640x335.jpg 640w, https://monstervine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Reblade-The-Death-Spiral-screenshot-02-1024x535.jpg 1024w, https://monstervine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Reblade-The-Death-Spiral-screenshot-02-1536x803.jpg 1536w, https://monstervine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Reblade-The-Death-Spiral-screenshot-02-2048x1071.jpg 2048w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px" /></a></p>
<h2>Parry Mechanical Beasts and Break Their Guard</h2>
<p>Combat asks you to study enemy moves, time parries, and break defenses to create openings for powerful attacks.</p>
<p>The enemies draw on ancient Chinese creatures, reimagined as machine-distorted threats. Your fight takes you from dark underground areas to a neon-lit city as you investigate the cycle&#8217;s repetition.</p>
<p><a href="https://monstervine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Reblade-The-Death-Spiral-screenshot.jpg"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="aligncenter size-medium wp-image-106479" src="https://monstervine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Reblade-The-Death-Spiral-screenshot-640x360.jpg" alt="Reblade The Death Spiral screenshot" width="640" height="360" srcset="https://monstervine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Reblade-The-Death-Spiral-screenshot-640x360.jpg 640w, https://monstervine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Reblade-The-Death-Spiral-screenshot-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://monstervine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Reblade-The-Death-Spiral-screenshot-1536x864.jpg 1536w, https://monstervine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Reblade-The-Death-Spiral-screenshot-600x337.jpg 600w, https://monstervine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Reblade-The-Death-Spiral-screenshot.jpg 1920w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px" /></a></p>
<h2>Experiment With Weapons, Chips, and Augments</h2>
<p>Weapons, skills, chips, and augments let you develop different builds across runs. Combining them lets you change your fighting style, while additional outfits offer appearance options for the heroine.</p>
<p><em>ReBlade: The Death Spiral</em> is in development for PC via Steam. The announcement does not include a release date for the full game.</p>
<p>You can download the free <a href="https://store.steampowered.com/app/3489340/ReBlade_The_Death_Spiral/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Steam</a> demo now and play through November 10.</p>
			</div><!--zox-post-body-->
